@title Home-Office Stipend Policy
@subtitle Effective January 1, 2027, Larkspur Analytics

kpi Setup stipend | $500 | one-time
kpi Monthly allowance | $40 | internet and phone
kpi Claim window | 60 days | from purchase

This policy explains the home-office stipend, which takes effect on January 1, 2027. Read the sections below to see whether you are covered, what you can claim and how.

## Who is covered
- All employees who work at least 3 days a week from home, after 90 days of service
- Part-time employees receive 50% of the stipend described below

## What you get
- A one-time setup stipend of $500
- $40 a month toward internet and phone
- The setup stipend can be used again after 3 years

## What you can buy
You can buy a desk, chair, monitor, keyboard, headset and lighting.

## How to claim
1. Submit receipts in the expense portal within 60 days of purchase.
2. Purchases over $250 need written manager approval before you buy.
3. Reimbursement arrives within 10 business days.

## What is not covered
- Gaming equipment
- Furniture for non-work use
- Software subscriptions
- Anything already supplied by the company

Questions go to finance-help@larkspur.example or to the #finance-help channel.
